Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Jason ripped open the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.47,0:00:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,courier bag.\NNewspaper. Outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.83,0:00:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,someone started dragging the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.87,0:00:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,warehouse shutter down. Lucia
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.87,0:00:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,looked past the empty
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.75,0:00:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,van. Mud covered every
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.75,0:00:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,tire except the spotless
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.19,0:00:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,spare underneath it. The
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.71,0:00:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Fixer had pointed at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.75,0:00:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,that bag too quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.27,0:00:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,She shoved a dolly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.15,0:00:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,beneath the spare. Jason
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.75,0:00:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,wanted the exit. Lucia
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.59,0:00:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,cut the wheel loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.79,0:00:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It landed heavily; folded
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.63,0:00:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,bills bulged through a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.83,0:00:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,split. Then the shutter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.35,0:00:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,hit the dolly handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.71,0:00:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Metal screamed. Their only
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.87,0:00:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,doorway stopped two feet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.39,0:00:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,above concrete. Jason dropped
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.31,0:00:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,flat and dragged the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.27,0:00:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,wheel under. Lucia followed,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.27,0:00:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,squeezing between the tire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.55,0:00:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and that trembling shutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.15,0:00:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The Fixer arrived holding
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.47,0:00:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,the newspaper bag. Their
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.95,0:00:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,getaway van outside was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.55,0:00:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,gone. His hidden fortune
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.39,0:00:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,rolled away. At the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.83,0:00:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,lockup, Jason asked how
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.35,0:00:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,she knew. Lucia tapped
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.07,0:00:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the clean rubber. Nobody
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.71,0:00:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,washes the spare.
